 $2.8 million, a remarkable Harlem townhouse that was once the abode of legendary musician Bob Dylan marks a notable real estate transaction. Located on the iconic Strivers' Row, this 1893 Renaissance Revival home, crafted by McKim, Mead &amp; White, features four levels. The previous renovations respected its original architectural style, showcasing a rising interest in residences that merge historical significance with today's conveniences.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2000-bob-dylan-sold-his-harlem-townhouse-for-560000-after-a-preservation-led-renovation-the-four-storey-strivers-row-residence-has-now-sold-for-2-8-million/articleshow/134288558.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2000-bob-dylan-sold-his-harlem-townhouse-for-560000-after-a-preservation-led-renovation-the-four-storey-strivers-row-residence-has-now-sold-for-2-8-million/articleshow/134288558.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-18T00:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134288873,imgsize-623077.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Visa news: Indian students to face new family restrictions in Australia, no 'visa hopping' allowed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134319415.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/visa-news-indian-students-to-face-new-family-restrictions-in-australia-no-visa-hopping-allowed/articleshow/134319415.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/visa-news-indian-students-to-face-new-family-restrictions-in-australia-no-visa-hopping-allowed/articleshow/134319415.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-18T00:04:12+05:30</pubDate><dc