hagi, alongside complex burial shafts and a variety of artifacts. These elements suggest a sprawling burial network, and ongoing explorations will further illuminate the history of burial practices in this ancient site.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/egyptian-archaeologists-uncovered-a-tomb-at-saqqara-with-3-sealed-sarcophagi-and-more-than-100-figurines-from-later-burials/articleshow/134304573.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/egyptian-archaeologists-uncovered-a-tomb-at-saqqara-with-3-sealed-sarcophagi-and-more-than-100-figurines-from-later-burials/articleshow/134304573.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T14:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134304645,imgsize-132059.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Dwayne Johnson: "Be humble. Be hungry. And always be…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134305278.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-dwayne-johnson-be-humble-be-hungry-and-always-be-a-powerful-lesson-in-staying-grounded-after-success/articleshow/134305278.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-dwayne-johnson-be-humble-be-hungry-and-always-be-a-powerful-lesson-in-staying-grounded-after-success/articleshow/134305278.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T16:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134305448,imgsize-28242.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York City volunteers planted 20,000 marsh seedlings in 2003; 80% were healthy by 2005]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134306485.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[New York City's Big Egg Marsh restoration began with planting 20,000 cordgrass seedlings.  Volunteers and scientists worked to re-establish the salt marsh ecosystem.  Despite early challenges, vegetation successfully covered over eighty percent of the site.  This successful project paved the way for further marsh restoration efforts.  Jamaica Bay has since seen over 150 acres of marshland restored.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-city-volunteers-planted-20000-marsh-seedlings-on-a-dying-salt-marsh-in-2003-but-80-of-the-site-was-healthy-just-two-years-later/articleshow/134306485.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-city-volunteers-planted-20000-marsh-seedlings-on-a-dying-salt-marsh-in-2003-but-80-of-the-site-was-healthy-just-two-years-later/articleshow/134306485.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T18:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134306598,imgsize-1461406.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[£2 million and a decade transformed a Welsh fort into a unique home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134309638.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-tech-entrepreneur-bought-a-ruined-welsh-island-fort-for-500000-but-after-2-million-and-a-decade-of-work-it-became-an-8000-sq-ft-off-grid-home/articleshow/134309638.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-tech-entrepreneur-bought-a-ruined-welsh-island-fort-for-500000-but-after-2-million-and-a-decade-of-work-it-became-an-8000-sq-ft-off-grid-home/articleshow/134309638.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T21:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134309946,imgsize-154324.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2019, seven detectorists found 2,584 silver pennies in a Somerset field; five years later...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134316358.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Recently, a noteworthy trove of Norman-era silver coins was obtained for the nation, worth £4.3 million, establishing it as the most significant treasure discovery in British history. This cache highlights the political turmoil that ensued post-Norman Conquest of England. Thanks to funding from the National Lottery Heritage Fund, this historic treasure will be displayed nationwide and will eventually find its way back to Somerset.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2019-seven-detectorists-found-2584-norman-era-silver-pennies-in-a-somerset-field-five-years-later-the-hoard-was-valued-at-4-3-million-the-highest-value-treasure-acquisition-on-record/articleshow/134316358.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-2019-seven-detectorists-found-2584-norman-era-silver-pennies-in-a-somerset-field-five-years-later-the-hoard-was-valued-at-4-3-million-the-highest-value-treasure-acquisition-on-record/articleshow/134316358.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T21:59:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134316938,imgsize-1102779.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Europe, Canada are stronger together’: Carney after Trump calls EU ‘associate member’ proposal ‘laughable’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134316506.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/europe-canada-are-stronger-together-carney-after-trump-calls-eu-associate-member-proposal-laughable/articleshow/134316506.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/europe-canada-are-stronger-together-carney-after-trump-calls-eu-associate-member-proposal-laughable/articleshow/134316506.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T21:37:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134316592,imgsize-67503.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jalen Hurts saw Philadelphia schools closing because they had no AC; after funding 300+ units...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134314897.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Philadelphia Eagles quarterback Jalen Hurts has pledged $600,000 for air conditioning at Northeast High School. This significant donation aims to improve classroom conditions for over 3,300 students. The funding will address long-standing heating and cooling challenges in the large, older building. This initiative builds upon his previous pledge of $200,000 for other city schools. The new units are expected to be ready before future hot weather disrupts classes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jalen-hurts-saw-philadelphia-schools-closing-because-they-had-no-ac-after-funding-300-units-he-is-now-giving-600000-to-the-citys-largest-high-school/articleshow/134314897.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jalen-hurts-saw-philadelphia-schools-closing-because-they-ha