arious markets throughout the United States.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-washington-entrepreneurs-started-a-dog-waste-cleanup-business-with-about-1000-six-years-later-swoop-scoop-says-the-operation-generates-more-than-200000-a-month-across-multiple-markets/articleshow/134305584.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/two-washington-entrepreneurs-started-a-dog-waste-cleanup-business-with-about-1000-six-years-later-swoop-scoop-says-the-operation-generates-more-than-200000-a-month-across-multiple-markets/articleshow/134305584.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-17T21:06:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134305910,imgsize-1896182.cms"/></item></channel></rss>